      "set_description": "<p><strong>【Set Bonus】</strong></p>\n<p><strong>2-Piece</strong></p>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        <p>Whenever a creature roll a check, you may force the creature to reroll one or both die. A creature can be affect by this effect <strong>once per day</strong></p>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>3-Piece</strong></p>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        <p>You gain a new Opportunity <strong>【⌛️ Misfortune】</strong></p>\n        <blockquote>\n            <p>You cause misfortune to befall your enemy, <strong>Choose:</strong></p>\n            <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1.5em;\">\n                <li>Deal 40 <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.XpKZuGo3VmT0TlTu\" data-id=\"XpKZuGo3VmT0TlTu\" data-type=\"Item\">Physical</a> damage to target creature</li>\n                <li>Inflicts an <strong>Advance Condition</strong> on target creature</li>\n            </ul>\n        </blockquote>\n    </li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>4-Piece</strong></p>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        <p>When you roll a <strong>Critical Success</strong> you get 2 <strong>Opportunity</strong> instead of 1. You must choose a different Opportunity for each instance.</p>\n    </li>\n</ul>",
